WEBVTT

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:55.420
<b>Mystery 2 "The Tail"</b>

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.680
Okay... It's okay...

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.820
<i>This is the Underworld!</i>

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.930
<i>I should be able to use words 
to communicate with a yokai!</i>

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.940
Good afternoon...

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.320
Abeno-san!

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.280
Hello? SOS! SOS!

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.320
Summon the Mononokean!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:24.220
I need an emergency evacuation! 
I ran into a savage beast!

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.080
And it's freaking huge!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.400
Hurry, before it catches up to...

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:33.000
Huh?

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.590
It's not chasing me?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.680
Did it leave?

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.420
Oh, crud. My legs are going to give out...

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.330
Hey, Zenko...

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.960
Don't move, Yahiko.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.340
I wanted to play with Haruitsuki, 
but I can't find him anywhere.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.340
Why don't you have Hanae play with you?

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:18.340
I don't like Ashiya.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.940
Fine. I'll play with Okina instead.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.340
Okina?

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.500
The kami at the mountain shrine?

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:33.310
Yeah! We've gotten to be good friends!

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.320
But first, tidy up the yard.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.120
Aww!

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:41.540
I've been letting you stay because you 
promised to help around the temple.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.020
No! No!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.240
I wanna play with Okina!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.700
No! I wanna play!

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.700
Then I'm not giving you the candies I bought.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:49.950
Candy?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.920
I'll do it! I'll tidy up the yard!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.240
Gimme candy.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.440
Once you're finished.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.960
Got it!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.210
Three, okay?

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.710
Two.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.470
Aww! Cheapskate!

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.920
You dropped this.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:07.720
Huh?

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:19.620
You dropped your sandal.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:23.490
Huh?

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.900
<i>Did this beast just speak?!</i>

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:31.000
You're one of the Legislator's tadpole lines.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.080
You work for the Legislator?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.100
You're going to the Birdcage?

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.920
I'm on my way there, too.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:41.160
<i>This beast knows the Executive?</i>

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.600
<i>Does he work for him?</i>

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:47.260
But I lost something around here.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.700
I'm in a bind.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.460
<i>He's not a savage beast at all!</i>

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.020
Will you help me look for it?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:05:01.320
I'm sorry. We're in a hurry to 
deliver something, so, well...

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.780
You can't?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.780
<i>Aw, jeez.</i>

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.300
It's golden and sparkly, 
so it should be easy to spot.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.500
I thought I'd find it right away.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.680
Golden and sparkly?

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.280
H-Hey, um...

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.550
Is the thing you lost made of metal?

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.800
Hmm?

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.180
Is it metal?

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.940
I think it's over there.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:49.920
<i>This reminds me of the time 
I looked for Manjirou's ring.</i>

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.120
I found it!

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.820
There, it's on.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.920
Wow, you're incredible.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:08.080
It took no time at all to find my tail ring.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.520
I'm good at finding metal objects.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.470
Now, let's head back to the path 
we were on and go to the Birdcage.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:17.980
Hey...

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:19.960
Yes?

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.560
Why don't you ride on my back?

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.240
I'll take you to the Birdcage.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.780
Goro Express, go!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.840
Goro seems so happy.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:36.250
Hanae, don't ride the dog!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.940
<i>Goro Express...</i>

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.160
You're sure it's okay?

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:48.510
Sure.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.010
So fluffy.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.620
Here we go.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.680
Okay!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.440
H-He's so fast!

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.820
<i>This turned out to be a thrill ride!</i>

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.000
I feel sick...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.900
Hold on tight so you don't fall off.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:26.250
<i>You tell me this now?!</i>

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.630
Huh?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.300
What?!

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.640
Oh, I jumped too far.

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.020
And hup, and hup...

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.020
We're here.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.530
Thank you.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.140
Who is it?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.540
I'm here on behalf of the Legislator.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.790
Ah, the Legislator?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.400
I won't eat you.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.680
I'm not allowed to eat meat.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.390
I'm an herbivore right now.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:21.880
This was mixed in with the 
Legislator's documents...

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:26.380
So he asked me to return it to the Executive.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.150
Thank you for the scroll and the message.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.940
Thanks for taking care of this.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.620
You look pale.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:38.040
Why don't you come rest inside?

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.410
I'm all right.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.660
You're not feeling well?

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:46.180
Want me to give you a ride back, too?

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:49.290
Oh, that's okay. I'm fine. I can make it back.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.050
You can ride on me.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:54.000
I can walk back.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.720
You're not going to ride, huh?

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.720
<i>He's drooling!</i>

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:02.470
Well, I'm hungry, so I guess this is goodbye.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:03.860
Okay.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.600
Walking all the way back 
to Newt Lake won't be easy.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.340
Shall I take you there?

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:13.700
No, really, don't worry about me.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.990
The Mononokean will meet me along the way.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.180
I'll be fine.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.080
<i>The Mononokean?</i>

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:23.250
<i>They're on their way to see Itsuki?</i>

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.660
Please excuse me.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:27.920
Thanks for the ride.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:34.620
<i>Unlike the capybara yokai, 
this savage beast was considerate.</i>

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.480
Tadpole, show me the way back, please.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:42.040
Come to think of it, can you call them again?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.020
I need to tell Abeno-san to pick me up.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:51.020
He petted me. How embarrassing.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:57.180
I've never seen him at the 
Legislator's place before.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.320
You seemed rather friendly.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.780
Do you know each other?

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.940
We just met.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.940
We ran into each other on the way here.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.790
I see.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.320
He could be new.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.320
Come to think of it, I didn't get his name.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:23.760
In that case, the Legislator 
might know, Mr. Justice.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.070
Brother, I made tea.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:34.700
Thanks.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.950
It's finished.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:44.180
Good work.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:46.700
That was some fast writing.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:50.100
I didn't think you'd finish it all today.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:52.760
You must be tired.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:53.880
Have some tea.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.740
I don't want any.

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:57.300
I'm going to borrow this.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.380
Huh?

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.300
That's fine, I guess.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.240
Mononokean, come.

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.980
Where are you going?

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:07.660
To pick up Ashiya from 
where I dropped him off.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.120
You're leaving already?

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:14.310
You should wait here until he 
asks you to come pick him up.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.070
He left.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.320
Itsuki is always in such a hurry.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.800
He could've had some tea before he left.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:55.620
Welcome back, Ashiya-kun.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:58.700
Whatever! At least I delivered the scroll!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:11:59.820
What?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:04.820
What do you mean, you got a ride on 
a beast resembling the Goro Express?

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.480
What the hell is the Goro Express?

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:08.880
It's the name of a dog that 
lived in my neighborhood!

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:13.000
I knew you were up to no good!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:19.460
B-But not all beasts are the 
same! This one was nice!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.420
He even said he's a vegetarian!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.220
He wasn't dangerous at all!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.590
You're only able to say that in hindsight!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:30.600
H-Hindsight? Use simpler words, please!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.540
You idiot!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.380
What?!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:33.300
You're an idiot!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.350
H-How am I—

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:38.180
You're both wrong.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.110
Good work, everyone.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:49.870
Thanks to your help, I finished all my work.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.500
Here's your payment.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.000
You can't even run an errand properly.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:59.480
Why are you yelling at me? 
I delivered the scroll.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:04.300
The Mononokean warned you 
not to follow strange yokai,

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.010
but you went right out and followed one.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:11.360
I did run at first.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.150
I didn't just immediately follow him.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.270
Huh?

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.120
But you ended up following him.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.270
<i>They're not listening.</i>

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.740
You really are useless.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:22.940
You should've come with me, then!

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.540
It's your fault for not supervising me.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:28.530
You're talking back to me?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:32.290
<i>Saying they're both wrong 
won't end this fight.</i>

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:38.290
As your superior, I can't let you 
leave while you're still fighting.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.550
Let's have a drink.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.060
What?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.900
Brother, we're coming in.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:45.800
Go ahead.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:50.320
Mr. Legislator, the preparations 
for the banquet have been made.

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:52.560
We got stuff other than sake, too.

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:55.240
They're already standing by?

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:58.040
You meant to drink from the start.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.560
Well, yeah.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:05.320
Hey, Brother, um... 
Can you do something for me?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.700
What is it? Spit it out.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:12.460
Well, since Itsuki and Ashiya are here,

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.780
I was hoping to invite 
Koura-sama to the banquet.

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.330
Would that be okay?

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.780
Koura-san? The lady from the Kiyakudo?

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:23.840
I'd like to see her, too. 
She took care of Fuzzy for us.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.590
You think Koura-sama's too busy?

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.020
Itsuki.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:32.720
Use the Mononokean to bring 
Koura here immediately.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.100
That's a rule.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.820
<i>He's abusing his position of power with</i>

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.850
<i>the most authoritative 
expression he's worn all day!</i>

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.080
Understood.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:41.860
<i>And this is the expression 
of his subordinate!</i>

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.860
Thanks, Brother!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:47.440
Oh, Itsuki, I'll go with you to get Koura-sama!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:01.080
Ch-Cheers?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.100
Cheers!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.640
Cheers.

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.630
Why are we eating in here?

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:15.600
The Mononokean can't enjoy the fun 
unless we celebrate here. Right?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.140
Cheers!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:21.140
It's a bit small, but I like how cozy it is.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.900
<i>He's not bothering to hide his reluctance!</i>

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.640
I like it, too, Koura-sama.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.980
Ashiya-kun, your ears are 
looking as good as ever.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:37.880
They'd make such good medicine. 
It's truly a waste.

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.580
Th-Thank you.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.560
My ears would make a better medicine.

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:46.420
I know they would.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:50.900
Itsuki, do you want a drink? It's not sake.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:51.760
No way.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:58.770
Mr. Legislator, I'd love a drink!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.340
It's gyomaroppe juice.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:06.020
Gyoma?

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:18.460
<i>But if I don't drink, the party 
they set up for us will be ruined!</i>

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.540
<i>What am I drinking right now?</i>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.050
Ashiya-kun, want some of these, too?

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.500
Yes, thank you.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.500
<i>What am I eating right now?</i>

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:54.630
<i>Abeno-san's eating and drinking, 
so it's safe, right? And it tastes fine!</i>

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:55.580
<i>Right!</i>

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.330
Did you have sake?

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.580
I-It was non-alcoholic, right?

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.140
My stomach is burning.

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:14.840
Abeno-san, water.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.340
Water...

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:18.780
I'll bring some medicine and water.

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.350
You just wait, Ashiya!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:25.340
Come to think of it, I've never 
fed him Underworld food before.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.850
Is it an allergic reaction?

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:31.980
Water... or tea, if you have it...

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.520
Ideally, I'd like some cafe au lait.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:40.280
Cafe... cafe... cafe au lait...

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:40.280
Mononokean, summon a door 
to the mundane world.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.790
Heading to the convenience store?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.400
I can have Shizuku make some tea.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:49.840
It'd be better to give him 
mundane world water.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:53.180
This seems to have happened 
because he ate Underworld food.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.580
If you're going to the other side, 
I'd like some ice cream, too.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.430
So hot...

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.380
So cold...

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.100
You got changed quick.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:13.460
Mononokean, I'll be right back. 
Leave the door as it is.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.690
See you later.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.060
Is he unconscious?

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:33.210
Is something wrong, or are you just drunk?

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.460
Oh, just...

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:39.280
Itsuki has certainly become very human.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:41.370
Right, Mononokean?

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.470
It's Hanae's influence.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:49.690
Oh, my. Does he seem that way to you?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:52.710
He seems like his usual self to me.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:57.990
That's just when he's dealing with us yokai.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.120
But when dealing with humans,

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:03.050
he can be strangely cruel.

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.750
I once asked him a mean question.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.420
If he could only save one...

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:19.880
...would you save yokai or humans?

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.630
Yokai.

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.670
That was quick.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:27.030
You don't care about saving humans?

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:35.800
Humans would be helped by someone 
else, even if I didn't do anything.

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:41.830
You're worried he might abandon Ashiya-kun?

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.090
I'm not sure anymore.

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:48.730
He seemed pretty concerned 
about Ashiya-kun today.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:53.160
I've never seen Itsuki express so 
much interest in a human before.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:56.840
You seem amused.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:00.920
I wonder how Itsuki would respond

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.430
if I asked him the same question again.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.150
Who can say?

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:09.390
If you keep asking such mean questions,

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:12.150
he'll probably try to avoid you even more.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.290
Even more?

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:16.690
Even more.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.440
Maybe I won't ask, then.

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:21.080
Are you going to let him keep going?

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:27.200
Becoming more human would 
probably be good for Itsuki,

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:32.700
but it may not be so good for 
the master of the Mononokean.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:39.540
That's true.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:46.090
But why don't we make a bet that 
he won't turn out that way,

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.630
Mononokean?

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.490
<b>Water</b>

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.250
<i>Will you take this bet, too,</i>

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:15.290
<i>Aoi?</i>

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:24.280
Who delivered this?

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:27.560
An employee of the Legislator.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.980
I'd never seen him before.

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:33.390
I haven't heard anything 
about a new employee.

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:35.400
What was he like?

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:38.790
Aside from being rather pale,
he was unremarkable.

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.650
Oh, he seemed to know the 
master of the Mononokean.

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:45.590
The Mononokean?

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.310
I see.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next time: "Greetings"</b>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:28.970
I don't only interact with yokai.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.130
I also have an ordinary school li—

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:34.010
What? A yokai's coming to school?!

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:36.060
Next time, "Greetings."

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:39.540
I'll tell them all about 
our wonderful school life!
